      "body": "大家好，我最近在业余时间做了一个小项目，想和大家分享。\n\n网站叫做 「学习方法论」（Better Thinking），主要收集和整理各种经典的方法论，比如第一性原理、费曼学习法、SMART原则、SWOT分析、Scrum敏捷、精益创业等等。\n\n我希望把这些方法论分门别类地整理出来，用通俗易懂的语言配合专业背景介绍，帮助大家快速理解和使用。同时也配有案例和应用场景，方便读者在工作、学习和生活中直接借鉴。\n\n👉 网站地址： https://thinking.jimbray.xyz/zh\n如果你对学习方法、思维模型、项目管理或战略分析感兴趣，欢迎来看看，也希望能得到大家的反馈 🙏，我也会持续更新更多方法论\n\n----\n\nHi everyone, I’d like to share a side project I’ve been working on recently.\n\nIt’s called Better Thinking – a website that collects and explains classic methodologies and thinking models, such as First Principles, the Feynman Technique, SMART Goals, SWOT Analysis, Scrum, Lean Startup, and many more.\n\nEach methodology is presented with:\n\nClear explanations in both professional and plain language\n\nStep-by-step usage guides\n\nPractical case studies for real-world application\n\nThe goal is to build a structured, easy-to-read knowledge base that helps learners and professionals quickly understand and apply these frameworks in work, study, and everyday life.\n\n👉 Website: https://thinking.jimbray.xyz/\n\nIf you’re interested in learning methods, mental models, project management, or strategy tools, feel free to explore — I’d love to hear your feedback! 🙌, and I’ll also keep updating the site with more methodologies over time.",
